{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/Eng.gif?t=1745422980\" /><strong>Welcome to CRITTER ISLE!</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/Darklung.gif?t=1745422980\" /> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A wonderful resort where you can immerse yourself in the role of island manager and caretaker for the Egglins, rare and mysterious critters taking the world by storm.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BECOME A FARMER </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/Farming.gif?t=1745422980\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With over 10 different crops, you'll have your work cut out for you learning how to grow all of them and figuring out your Egglin's favorite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DECORATE YOUR ISLAND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/Decoration.gif?t=1745422980\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every good environment deserves some homey touches, and with over 60 different island decorations, you can customize every inch of your island to suit your fancy. The Egglins will appreciate you for making their world your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>COLLECT EGGLINS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/Hatching.gif?t=1745422980\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once the first egg hatches you'll be dying to hatch more and collect the over 60 known Egglins throughout the world! And don't worry about losing track of them. The Bestiary logs all of your discovered Egglins throughout your collecting adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So are you ready to take this once in a lifetime opportunity and start your Egglin collecting adventure?\u00a0Just remember, be good to the Egglins, and the Egglins...<i>may be good to you</i>... possibly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Oh and no return deposit for the Island.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Have fun!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3560880?t=1745422980","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/fb258d1ba73c58fa15911be9831cd95a5e23d42e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745422980","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/fa87ba76592b2621f25618dd8458b331b8576402/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745422980","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/fa87ba76592b2621f25618dd8458b331b8576402/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745422980","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/Eng.gif?t=1745422980\" /><strong>Welcome to CRITTER ISLE!</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/Darklung.gif?t=1745422980\" /> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A wonderful resort where you can immerse yourself in the role of island manager and caretaker for the Egglins, rare and mysterious critters taking the world by storm.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BECOME A FARMER </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/Farming.gif?t=1745422980\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With over 10 different crops, you'll have your work cut out for you learning how to grow all of them and figuring out your Egglin's favorite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DECORATE YOUR ISLAND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/Decoration.gif?t=1745422980\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every good environment deserves some homey touches, and with over 60 different island decorations, you can customize every inch of your island to suit your fancy. The Egglins will appreciate you for making their world your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>COLLECT EGGLINS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/extras/Hatching.gif?t=1745422980\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once the first egg hatches you'll be dying to hatch more and collect the over 60 known Egglins throughout the world! And don't worry about losing track of them. The Bestiary logs all of your discovered Egglins throughout your collecting adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So are you ready to take this once in a lifetime opportunity and start your Egglin collecting adventure?\u00a0Just remember, be good to the Egglins, and the Egglins...<i>may be good to you</i>... possibly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Oh and no return deposit for the Island.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Have fun!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Jesse F","Tyler C","Ben P"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560880/3d92292a626e5055332ec7d1e346462ebbaa56ae/header.jpg?t=1745422980","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257108920,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108920/movie480.mp4?t=1741148382","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108920/movie_max.mp4?t=1741148382"},"name":"Critter Isle Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257108920/aa629a714f3bb0894f0c92147f49aaba66a3e539/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741148382","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108920/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741148382","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108920/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741148382"}}],"name":"Critter Isle","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86_32 CPU with SSE2 instructions, any x86_64 CPU, ARMv8 CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics with full Vulkan 1.0 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Pixel Frog"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"30 Apr, 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://share